@host = http://localhost:5222

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

### Login (copy accessToken into @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user@example.com", "password": "Passw0rd!" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Profile
GET {{host}}/api/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Securities issuers
GET {{host}}/api/securities-issuers?page=1&limit=25
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Company clients
GET {{host}}/api/company-clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Countries
GET {{host}}/api/countries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
